"非常に勝ち気な性格で、いつも主人公や太一と衝突している幼馴染み。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"面倒見は非常に良く、主人公の相手ばかりでなく、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスメイトや教員から相談や頼まれ事を引き受けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見攻撃的なのでサディストにも見えるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どこかで従う相手を探しているようなそぶりも見え隠れしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22755","sourceWorkId":"3361","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"非常に勝ち気な性格で、いつも主人公や太一と衝突している幼馴染み。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"面倒見は非常に良く、主人公の相手ばかりでなく、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスメイトや教員から相談や頼まれ事を引き受けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見攻撃的なのでサディストにも見えるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どこかで従う相手を探しているようなそぶりも見え隠れしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22755","sourceWorkId":"3872","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"非常に勝ち気な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも主人公や太一と衝突している幼馴染み。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"面倒見は非常に良く、主人公の相手ばかりでなく、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスメイトや教員から相談や頼まれ事を引き受けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見攻撃的なのでサディストにも見えるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どこかで従う相手を探しているようなそぶりも見え隠れしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22755","sourceWorkId":"4880","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"非常に勝ち気な性格で、いつも主人公や太一と衝突している幼馴染み。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"面倒見は非常に良く、主人公の相手ばかりでなく、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスメイトや教員から相談や頼まれ事を引き受けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一見攻撃的なのでサディストにも見えるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どこかで従う相手を探しているようなそぶりも見え隠れしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22755","sourceWorkId":"4881","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"非常に勝ち気な性格で、いつも主人公や太一と衝突している幼馴染み。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"面倒見は非常に良く、主人公の相手ばかりでなく"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスメイトや教員から相談や頼まれ事を引き受けている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22755","sourceWorkId":"4882","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のクラスメートでもっとも親しい人物である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仲は良いのだが発想の違いからよく衝突し合う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただしそれは気の許せる相手だからこそ本音が言えるのであり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"衝突そのものはじゃれあいのようなものである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実質的には面倒見良く忍耐強い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の世話女房役である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家庭は汎用である。ごくごく平均的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スポーツをこよなく愛する運動系。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公はたまに涼香のことをじゃまだと思う節もあるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本心からじゃまだと思ったり目の上のたんこぶと考えるわけではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小うるさいけどしかたがないか、程度である。いわば小姑。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"細々と口うるさい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頼まれても居ないのに弁当を作ってきたりと世話焼くのが好き。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"109927"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7bc389e56373e233d2d77c9a2fbe9ca8bb8dbca8ecf71e217a378daf938864c6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/9359b076f658989cf1d6631ed60c8f9efb5cda72f7da5a182a2d38477c354025.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"友永朱音","creatorId":"vndb:s83","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s83","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s83","name":"友永 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:113314:109927:4432:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c40790","characterName":"檻都 美久","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"110398","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"113318"},{"characterId":"110398","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"113319"},{"characterId":"110398","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"113320"},{"characterId":"110398","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"113322"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22757"],"vndbCharacterId":"c40790"},"originalCharacterName":"檻都 美久","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Classmate to the protagonist. She is unhappy with the way she is treated due to her status as a rich young lady, she wishes to change that sentiment."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she is high class she does not give off that aura. She speaks what she wants to speak, however, conversations do not last long. She is the classic yamato nadeshiko who is attentive in the sense of taking care of men."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In terms of status, she is the heroine of the school and everyone looks up to her. She is frustrated by the fact that she is viewed as a heroine by others. She wishes to hang out with friends, but others around her say, \"she really doesn't do that kind of thing, does she?\". As a result she doesn't get invited to things."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She also secretly wears red toenail polish, which is prohibited by school rules. This is an expression of her true feelings of not wanting to remain a \"heroine\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c40790"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のクラスメイトのお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女自身は、お嬢様扱いされたり、特別扱いされることに不満を感じているようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな自分を、彼女は変えたいと思っているが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22757","sourceWorkId":"3799","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のクラスメイトのお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女自身は、お嬢様扱いされたり、特別扱いされることに不満を感じているようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな自分を、彼女は変えたいと思っているが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22757","sourceWorkId":"3872","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスメイトのお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もっとも、自分がお嬢様として扱われることや、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特別扱いをされてしまうことに不満を感じているようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな自分を変えていきたい、と思っているようだが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22757","sourceWorkId":"4880","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスメイトのお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もっとも、自分がお嬢様として扱われることや、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特別扱いをされてしまうことに不満を感じているようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな自分を変えていきたい、と思っているようだが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22757","sourceWorkId":"4882","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスメイトのお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もっとも、自分がお嬢様として扱われることや、 特別扱いをされてしまうことに不満を感じているようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな自分を変えていきたい、と思っているようだが……。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"110398"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/51/51d26b359f7f4d242a817cfc199e2f10ba0289f6e41cfc71e774ea3f2b727469.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6b/6b5cdbaed0f129fbf88ef83f818ba99b4cdabc1a940c2d7d92fd310046aa8ecd.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"永井ちひろ","creatorId":"vndb:s530","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s530","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s530","name":"逢川奈々","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:113314:110398:18652:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c138070","characterName":"鈴木公志","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c138070"},"originalCharacterName":"鈴木公志","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist. He is childhood friend's with Suzuka. He's neither dumb or smart, he's average, generic, and bland. At worst, he can be indecisive and emotional."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is very interested in sex, especially because he's at that age. He's even interested in sex with people he doesn't particularly have any interest in, his desire is so strong he is ready for the act whenever wherever."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c138070"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c40791","characterName":"草薙 千聡","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c40791"},"originalCharacterName":"草薙 千聡","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A woman of few words. She is a sadist at heart with a lustful thought process. She has a rather dark personality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She finds motivation in teasing the main character, however, she doesn't enjoy just sexual acts. Sexual acts are just a part of teasing for her, and her interest in actual sexual intercourse is very low."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a queen by profession, she teaches and does sex work as a part time job. She doesn't have the mindset of making others feel good for the sake of it. Her sexual satisfaction comes from different motives, by subduing and humiliating others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She becomes incredibly interested and attached to the main protagonist. She also wishes to bring Suzuka into her world."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c40791"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/94228a25bf109788f4e51a04c031e9c9707b294240833f674df8cd3271b0a98a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/54/543c5dd7d1f86b7dcc2f4cc1d85c3c914a2953e7ad1fe00e7b32ce77e5ca7740.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"北都 南","creatorId":"vndb:s113","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s113","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s113","name":"ひと美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:2901","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c40792","characterName":"笹宮 太一","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c40792"},"originalCharacterName":"笹宮 太一","char